  "headline": "Net Revenue fell 16.4% (Rs 29.06 lakh) during the week of 6 July 2026 to 12 July 2026 compared to the prior week.",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "We evaluated Net Revenue movements across daily grains using difference-in-differences, placebo timing checks, and control segment comparisons.",
      "tier_from": "drivers[0]"
    },
    {
      "text": "The top localized segment, West / App / Laptops, accounted for Rs 11.92 lakh or 41.0% of the category-wide decline across a support size of 102.",
      "tier_from": "localization[0]"
    },
    {
      "text": "A second localized segment, West / App / Mobiles, accounted for 23.0% of the category-wide decline (Rs 6.70 lakh) across a support size of 343.",
      "tier_from": "localization[1]"
    },
    {
      "text": "Decomposition indicates volume loss drove 93.5% of the overall decomposed metric gap (Rs 9.00 lakh), while price accounted for 6.5% (Rs 62,860).",
      "tier_from": "decomposition"
    },
    {
      "text": "Testing confirmed broader West region movement, where the treated segment shifted -12.7% against a 0.0% control baseline (z=-2.6).",
      "tier_from": "drivers[0]"
    },
    {
      "text": "Placebo timing checks for the West region driver yielded a -5.4pp diff-in-diff shift compared to a noise standard deviation of 4.9pp over 10 windows.",
      "tier_from": "drivers[0]"
    },
    {
      "text": "Testing for broader App channel movement also survived falsification, showing a -12.7% treated change versus 0.0% in control (z=-2.6).",
      "tier_from": "drivers[1]"
    },
    {
      "text": "We rejected hypothesis DRIVER-PRIMARY-DID (strict localization to West / App / Laptops) because its diff-in-diff test produced a z-score of -1.5 (treated -19.0% vs control 0.0%).",
      "tier_from": "rejected_hypotheses[0]"
    },
    {
      "text": "A potential confound of broader Laptops category movement was rejected after the control segment moved -10.0%.",
      "tier_from": "rejected_hypotheses[1]"
    },
    {
      "text": "Finance Operations should deploy paid_marketing_spend to address the West region driver, targeting an expected recovery of Rs 29.06 lakh and monitoring after 14 days for a baseline recovery within 2%.",
      "tier_from": "action"
    }
  ]
